    "title": "Greater Mankato Rotary awards 'Service Above Self' honors - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mitch Keegan ,\n7 hours ago MANKATO, Minn. (KEYC) - The Greater Mankato Rotary presented this year’s ‘Service Above Self’ awards. Trisha Anderson from Partners for Housing, Jim and Jennie Ward, who contributed to VINE’s renovations, Robert Fitterer, and the Blue Earth County Historical Society were all honored with the award. The... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
